# FRONT BUGFIX — gates

**Артефакты:** с эпиком `memory-bank/front/bugfix/<epic_id>/bugfix-queue.yaml` (`epic-bugfix-queue/v1`, status SoT) + `bugfix-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md`; без эпика — `bugfix-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md`. @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc
**Anti-minimal:** @.cursor/rules/shared/_lean/anti-minimal-done.mdc — local partial OK; contract/SoT UI regression → DENY old / `wire_complete` bar

## Gates

1. Баг описан; `load_now` first; core — cross-cutting (§8)
2. Root cause; no mask; regression red → fix → green
3. **Scenario:** user-visible UI → Playwright targeted обязателен; **parent** runs
4. Visible UI → Read design stack (6 из workflow-implement) **до** UI edit
5. Queue first: первый `open`/`in_progress` → `in_progress` → targeted scenario green → `done` + evidence + done_at; partial между сессиями допустим, прыжок через open запрещён. Report — narrative only; **Источник:** queue + QA.
5a. После **одного** item при ещё open: сессия может выйти без `loop.py finish` — loop `PROGRESS_CONTINUE` / re-arm BUGFIX (это не `finish_not_committed`). `verify-bugfix` **только** когда все items terminal.
5b. Все items terminal → только full `verification.command` + `verification.status=pass`; затем `verify-bugfix` → **обязан** `loop.py finish --step BUGFIX` → re-QA. FAIL verify → gate-repair / append open, остаёмся BUGFIX.
6. §0.11 если applicable
7. FINISH: finish-block; next-mode — `memory-bank/activeContext.md` + decompose index · `finish-doc-router.md` §BUGFIX FINISH

## Abort

- Workaround · tests skipped · user-visible без Playwright · «manual smoke only» → no FINISH
- FINISH при missing queue, open item или verification != pass → FAIL
